File-type and folder icons of the Lithe desktop client.

The SVGs in svg/ are the file-tree icons the previous Lithe macOS client shipped in
macos/Resources/IDEAIcons/, restored byte for byte from commit f1e8d8139^ of this
repository. Except for the two noted below, they come from the JetBrains IntelliJ
Platform Community repository (https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community) and are
distributed under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt. The previous
client's NOTICE.txt records their source paths and revisions, chiefly:

- fileTypes/*.svg: platform/icons/src/expui/fileTypes/ (revisions
  e8d21e84ee23f99ae7237fbb4530ff2e7c3b47c5, c7f91397daa3a961b4e78bc634fe467a0a7d9ade,
  fb72b4df43ab and d67fdc5458cd370ecb1bf7831604a4add781113d); custom.svg is
  platform/icons/src/fileTypes/custom.svg; lock is expui/general/locked; readme is
  expui/status/info; nodejs is
  plugins/kotlin/base/resources/resources/org/jetbrains/kotlin/idea/icons/expui/wizard/nodejs.
- folder.svg and excludeRoot.svg: platform/icons/src/expui/nodes/ (revision
  e8d21e84ee23f99ae7237fbb4530ff2e7c3b47c5).
- svg/tree/treechevronDown.svg and treechevronRight.svg (and their _dark variants): the previous
  client's expui/general/chevronDown.svg and chevronRight.svg, restored byte for byte
  from repository commit 5a54c41aa37a4e6e6b68918a4b05765b9dd07a36.
- class.svg, sourceRoot.svg, resourcesRoot.svg, moduleJava.svg, and package.svg (and their
  _dark siblings): platform/icons/src/expui/nodes/ (revision
  e8d21e84ee23f99ae7237fbb4530ff2e7c3b47c5), from the same batch as folder.svg and
  excludeRoot.svg.
- variable.svg: the previous client's nodes/variable.svg, an IntelliJ Community New UI node
  icon with a 2000-2023 JetBrains copyright header; the previous NOTICE.txt did not record its
  source revision. The same-named icon is present at platform/icons/src/expui/nodes/variable.svg
  in revision c7f91397daa3a961b4e78bc634fe467a0a7d9ade.
- db_set_breakpoint.svg, db_verified_breakpoint.svg, db_disabled_breakpoint.svg, and
  db_muted_breakpoint.svg (and their _dark siblings): IntelliJ Community classic debugger icons
  from platform/icons/src/debugger/ in the previous client's debugger/ assets (copyright headers
  2000-2021 JetBrains); the previous NOTICE.txt did not record their source revision.

license.svg and makefile.svg (and their _dark siblings) are original Lithe icons,
because the Community set has no LICENSE or Makefile glyph; they follow the Lithe
repository license.

Copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors. Lithe does not include JetBrains product
logos.

Modification: icons.go is not the SVGs themselves. scripts/desktop/generate-desktop-file-icons.sh
rewrites each SVG into filled paths only (its strokes become outlines of the same color)
with picosvg and compiles the result into gfx.Icon values. The SVG sources in svg/ are
unmodified. The generator changes underscores in SVG filenames to hyphens when deriving Go
names, so db_set_breakpoint.svg is exposed as DbSetBreakpoint.
